WEBVTT

00:08.750 --> 00:12.710
He doesn't love you in the slightest.

00:13.920 --> 00:14.790
Stop.

00:17.210 --> 00:19.880
Soon enough, he'll leave your side.

00:20.290 --> 00:22.710
That can't be. That can't be!

00:31.580 --> 00:32.460
Lieselotte!

00:33.750 --> 00:34.710
Your Highness...

00:35.080 --> 00:36.920
It's such a lovely day out.

00:36.920 --> 00:38.960
Just look how beautiful the sky is!

00:39.710 --> 00:44.540
But of all the things in this world,
you're the most beautiful, of course.

00:45.170 --> 00:47.580
Wh-what a ridiculous statement!

00:48.080 --> 00:51.750
Comparing the sky to me is ludicrous, to say the least.

00:52.250 --> 00:55.080
What's more, it's an affront to mother nature herself!

00:55.500 --> 00:58.500
The way you're so humble just makes you the cutest!

00:58.710 --> 01:00.580
W-would you please listen?!

01:01.210 --> 01:03.580
His Highness seems different from before.

01:03.830 --> 01:05.540
That's the kind of thing I do!

01:05.960 --> 01:06.960
I should follow suit.

01:07.250 --> 01:10.080
Coming on strong, huh? Way to go, Sieg!

01:10.080 --> 01:14.750
Remember the only thing that can protect Liese-tan from
the Witch of Yore is your passionate display of love, Sieg!

01:15.210 --> 01:18.750
Ienai kimochi ni kizuite

01:18.750 --> 01:24.880
Ibitsu de bukiyou na kotoba de tsutaeru kara

01:25.130 --> 01:28.040
Kitto kimi ni

01:37.290 --> 01:40.250
Itsumo gomakashichau yo

01:40.250 --> 01:42.670
(Doki doki barenai youni)

01:42.750 --> 01:47.920
Zenbu mabushisugiru kimi no sei dayo

01:48.170 --> 01:50.960
Kawaiku nante narenaiyo

01:50.960 --> 01:52.710
(Datte niawanai desho?)

01:52.710 --> 01:55.540
Sono me ni utsuru sora mo

01:55.540 --> 01:58.830
Massugu mitsumerarenakute

01:58.830 --> 02:04.170
Uso darake no sekai ni itsumade iru no?

02:04.170 --> 02:09.080
Kono mamaja nanimo kaerarenai

02:09.250 --> 02:11.790
Sonna no iya dayo

02:11.790 --> 02:17.920
Moshimo kamisama ga kimochi tsugete kuretatoshitemo

02:17.920 --> 02:23.210
Itsuka jibun no koe de kimi no koto ga suki dato tsutaetai

02:23.460 --> 02:32.000
Moshimo ibitsudemo taisetsu na omoi dokoka kiechau mae ni

02:32.500 --> 02:35.210
Yuuki dasu kara

02:45.290 --> 02:49.210
<b>Chapter 8</b>

02:45.290 --> 02:49.210
<b>Master and Disciple, the Mask, and Tsundereally-Pissed</b>

02:45.540 --> 02:48.040
Gotta use our days off to make
major headway on the game!

02:48.380 --> 02:49.210
Yeah.

02:49.460 --> 02:54.420
We're at a crucial point, now that the Anti-Witch of Yore
Task Force to protect Lieselotte is coming together.

02:54.750 --> 02:58.040
We've got Bal, Art, Fabby-boo and Liese-tan's dad!

02:58.040 --> 03:01.080
With Sieg super determined on the forefront.

03:01.460 --> 03:05.540
And didn't Fiene's mom say something
about convincing Professor Leon?

03:05.540 --> 03:10.670
Yeah... But Professor's Leon's the hardest
character to win over, isn't he?

03:10.670 --> 03:12.170
He might be a lost cause.

03:12.540 --> 03:16.330
And we can't watch them talk because
we don't have access to their POV.

03:16.330 --> 03:17.210
Yeah...

03:34.080 --> 03:34.830
Who's there?!

03:38.380 --> 03:41.960
Heya, Leon! Look at you, all grown up.

03:42.380 --> 03:43.710
You're kidding me.

03:44.330 --> 03:49.580
So you know how Fiene's mom implied
that she knew Professor Leon?

03:49.580 --> 03:51.630
I can't imagine how they would know each other.

03:51.630 --> 03:53.380
Actually, they know each other really well.

03:53.380 --> 03:54.080
Huh?

03:54.630 --> 03:58.000
Their relationship is really kept under wraps.

04:07.420 --> 04:08.330
Ooh!

04:08.670 --> 04:10.290
It's Duke Marschner...

04:11.830 --> 04:14.250
and the Fae Princess, Lady Elizabeth.

04:14.580 --> 04:16.710
She's as beautiful as ever.

04:17.130 --> 04:22.920
My heartfelt congratulations on your son,
Lord Leon, turning seven.

04:23.250 --> 04:25.960
Thank you, Duke Marschner.

04:26.750 --> 04:29.420
They say he's the bastard son of the count's mistress.

04:27.210 --> 04:31.580
I sincerely hope for your boy's healthy development
and House Schach's continued success.

04:29.920 --> 04:33.420
Apparently the count took him in
because he had no legitimate son.

04:32.380 --> 04:33.790
And what an intelligent-looking boy he is!

04:34.130 --> 04:35.290
My, the lucky little wretch.

04:34.130 --> 04:35.290
Oh, not at all-

04:38.880 --> 04:40.580
Is that a mouse I see there?!

04:44.880 --> 04:45.500
Hurry, catch it!

04:54.960 --> 04:57.080
Well, that was a friggin' drag.

04:57.670 --> 04:59.580
Uh, Fae Princess... ?

04:59.580 --> 05:03.580
Hey, I'd rather you didn't use that silly nickname of mine.

05:03.580 --> 05:05.460
I-I'm sorry.

05:05.630 --> 05:08.330
Hey, no worries! Don't be so uptight.

05:08.920 --> 05:11.540
U-um, that mouse back there...

05:11.750 --> 05:14.460
You made it appear using magic... didn't you?

05:15.920 --> 05:17.080
You noticed, huh?

05:17.080 --> 05:20.000
He's a buddy of mine, Karlchen!

05:20.420 --> 05:23.130
We sneak little tidbits of food from the kitchen together.

05:23.420 --> 05:26.500
You don't seem like any noble princess I know.

05:26.830 --> 05:30.080
Aww, thanks! That's sweet of you to say!

05:30.080 --> 05:31.330
That wasn't a compliment.

05:31.880 --> 05:33.670
Why did you do such a thing?

05:34.210 --> 05:37.500
Well Leon, because you were
looking really miserable earlier.

05:37.880 --> 05:40.420
So bad, I felt compelled to get you out of there.

05:41.380 --> 05:44.500
So they met seventeen years ago?!

05:44.710 --> 05:49.290
It's their first meeting as adults after all this time.
It's kind of exciting!

05:49.290 --> 05:51.750
Maybe there'll be a romantic development.

05:52.130 --> 05:54.380
Seriously, what do you think you're doing?

05:54.630 --> 05:56.630
Hey. I'm sorry, okay?

05:56.830 --> 06:00.040
I was hoping to surprise you,
but I was in for a surprise myself!

06:00.040 --> 06:03.710
Honestly, you're just as outrageous
as you were when we first met.

06:03.710 --> 06:05.670
Aw, thanks!

06:05.670 --> 06:06.880
That wasn't a compliment!

06:07.790 --> 06:11.580
To tell you the truth, I'm amazed
your still conscious right now.

06:12.040 --> 06:14.670
That trap was set up with all sorts of spells.

06:15.040 --> 06:20.250
Ones for weakening and sleep, as well as paralysis,
hallucinations, memory disorientation...

06:20.250 --> 06:22.250
Wow, the works!

06:22.710 --> 06:28.040
I learned all the basics from you,
Master, back when I was seven.

06:28.380 --> 06:29.960
Yes, that's right.

06:30.880 --> 06:36.080
I have to say I'm glad to see my little disciple
become far more capable than I ever was!

06:36.290 --> 06:38.040
Really, I'm impressed.

06:38.420 --> 06:42.250
You know there's a bunch of stuff
in here I have to keep hidden.

06:42.710 --> 06:47.960
You're the one who passed
this secret chamber on to me, after all.

06:49.830 --> 06:51.790
Oh, I remember this!

06:51.790 --> 06:54.960
I used this when I first befriended Karlchen!

06:58.250 --> 07:00.580
What are you, exactly?

07:01.420 --> 07:04.040
Hmm, if I have to give an answer,

07:04.330 --> 07:06.750
a person of ambition, I guess?

07:07.500 --> 07:08.540
"Ambition"?

07:08.920 --> 07:12.420
Yup. I've got a plan in mind.

07:12.750 --> 07:18.710
That's why I taught myself forbidden curses that
shady individuals use, and pretend I'm a fine, noble lady.

07:23.210 --> 07:25.540
All to deceive my enemies.

07:26.500 --> 07:27.960
"Enemies"? Really?

07:28.540 --> 07:33.250
Yeah, enemies. To me, my family and
aristocratic society are all my enemies.

07:34.580 --> 07:40.080
They're detestable enemies who want
to take my beloved, August, away from me.

07:41.960 --> 07:43.420
You're the same, aren't you?

07:43.830 --> 07:45.330
Your family here,

07:46.130 --> 07:48.290
and everyone else. They're enemies.

07:58.500 --> 07:59.750
Would I...

08:00.880 --> 08:05.170
Would I be able to learn how to use that kind of magic?

08:07.040 --> 08:11.380
I became your student that day,
and learned so much from you.

08:11.750 --> 08:16.540
It was less than a year you taught me,
but you saved me more than you could ever know.

08:17.000 --> 08:20.040
Master. No, Elizabe-

08:20.040 --> 08:24.670
When one is wearing a mask,
it's not right to mention their name.

08:25.540 --> 08:28.750
You should know the basic etiquette
for a masquerade ba-

08:29.830 --> 08:34.040
And taking a lady's mask off without
asking is a definite offense.

08:34.880 --> 08:39.250
I just had to see the precious face
of the woman I adore so much.

08:40.790 --> 08:42.790
You haven't changed in the slightest.

08:43.290 --> 08:46.460
You sure have grown, Leon.

08:46.920 --> 08:50.790
Yes, I'm as old as your husband once was.

08:54.170 --> 08:59.880
Anyway, there's a reason I came here today.
I have a favor to ask of you.

09:00.330 --> 09:02.460
A favor, you say?

09:02.880 --> 09:06.380
My Fiene has a new sister, Lieselotte.

09:06.710 --> 09:12.290
Apparently there's some despicable villain
plotting to sacrifice her to destroy the world.

09:12.790 --> 09:15.380
I was hoping you could help out, Leon.

09:15.710 --> 09:16.460
If...

09:17.500 --> 09:20.580
If I agree to help you out...

09:22.880 --> 09:26.080
No, I would rather not get mixed up in trouble.

09:26.880 --> 09:27.880
I see.

09:28.790 --> 09:34.000
What an ungrateful disciple!
I don't remember raising you this way!

09:34.000 --> 09:36.670
I don't remember you ever raising me, either!

09:38.500 --> 09:45.000
No worries, I kinda figured you'd say no.
At least I got to see your smiling face, though.

09:45.420 --> 09:46.920
That's good enough for me

09:47.330 --> 09:48.290
I'm sorr-

09:48.710 --> 09:49.460
Bye, then!

09:50.130 --> 09:51.250
You forgot this!

09:58.170 --> 09:59.000
Mommy?

09:59.960 --> 10:01.290
You're still up?

10:01.290 --> 10:02.920
I heard footsteps.

10:03.130 --> 10:06.250
Where did you go? To see Professor Leon?

10:06.580 --> 10:09.540
Yes, but I had trouble convincing him.

10:09.960 --> 10:10.830
I see.

10:11.380 --> 10:12.540
I'm sorry.

10:12.880 --> 10:16.460
It's fine! We'll figure it out without his help!

10:16.460 --> 10:18.130
Okay then, good night!

10:21.000 --> 10:23.540
Really, I'm so sorry...

10:23.920 --> 10:27.170
<b>Riefenstahl Villa-Hallway</b>

10:23.920 --> 10:25.330
<b>Elizabeth</b>

10:23.920 --> 10:25.330
<b>Really, I'm so sorry...</b>

10:26.380 --> 10:28.170
Guess it didn't work out, huh?

10:28.460 --> 10:30.670
She looks so torn.

10:31.380 --> 10:35.130
But Elizabeth must understand how Professor Leon feels.

10:35.540 --> 10:38.080
That's probably why she couldn't push it too hard.

10:38.670 --> 10:40.330
That's gotta be tough.

10:40.330 --> 10:41.330
Yeah...

10:44.330 --> 10:46.130
Stop. Please...

10:47.170 --> 10:50.580
Don't leave me! To me, you're-

10:52.880 --> 10:55.290
Good morning, my lady.

10:55.790 --> 10:56.750
Come in.

10:58.630 --> 11:01.750
Another lovely gift came for you this morning.

11:03.830 --> 11:06.460
Jewelry yesterday, and a bouquet of flowers today!

11:06.710 --> 11:09.580
"For my dear Lieselotte, with affection."

11:09.830 --> 11:12.040
What a kind soul he is!

11:12.380 --> 11:14.960
Could you put these flowers in the hall and not in here?

11:15.750 --> 11:17.000
My lady...

11:17.960 --> 11:19.460
Good morning, Lieselotte!

11:21.170 --> 11:25.040
Very nice! It's another day of Sieg
making direct shows of affection!

11:25.920 --> 11:27.960
Did you like those flowers I sent?

11:27.960 --> 11:29.880
Lieselotte responds by avoiding him!

11:31.170 --> 11:33.460
Lieselotte, there's a seat open over here!

11:34.000 --> 11:35.130
And again!

11:40.670 --> 11:41.880
Let's go home together!

11:41.880 --> 11:45.880
Whoa! He practically forced her onto his carriage!

11:45.880 --> 11:48.960
There's no way for her to avoid him in there, after all!

11:49.290 --> 11:50.290
Lieselotte.

11:51.250 --> 11:53.710
What kind of dress would you like
to wear for the Festival of Gratitude?

11:54.040 --> 11:55.670
I want it to be a gift from me.

11:56.040 --> 11:59.710
Of course, the designs of
our attire should match as a couple.

11:59.710 --> 12:04.540
W-well, I have no qualms as long as it is not
so vulgar as to bring you shame, Your Highness.

12:04.540 --> 12:09.580
But surely you could take appropriate care of such
matters without the need for my input.

12:09.920 --> 12:14.000
Is that so? Then I suppose I'll choose
something I want to see you wear.

12:14.000 --> 12:16.040
Well, gold is a must.

12:16.290 --> 12:19.460
It's the color of my eyes and your hair, after all.

12:20.540 --> 12:23.750
I-I bid you not to dishevel my hair, Your Highness!

12:24.380 --> 12:25.130
Sorry.

12:25.540 --> 12:29.250
You're right, I'll save disheveling
your hair for another occasion.

12:29.500 --> 12:30.670
"Another occasion"?

12:30.880 --> 12:31.920
What occasion?!

12:37.000 --> 12:38.130
Lieselotte!

12:38.500 --> 12:40.290
This will do, thank you very much!

12:40.670 --> 12:43.540
I appreciate you escorting me home!

12:44.000 --> 12:45.380
Lieselotte...

12:49.830 --> 12:51.290
What do I do?

12:51.670 --> 12:56.540
True, Lieselotte's prickliness
has been out of control recently.

12:56.880 --> 13:02.830
Well, I can't help but wish she wouldn't fight
my affection quite so much, I must admit.

13:03.630 --> 13:08.580
My apologies. Liese is unreasonably clumsy
when it comes to interpersonal relationships.

13:09.630 --> 13:13.040
It's because she strived to be worthy of being your bride,

13:13.540 --> 13:17.000
and devoted all of her attention
on bettering herself from a young age.

13:17.710 --> 13:21.580
I guess that's what happens when
you cling to your first love for over a decade.

13:22.130 --> 13:23.000
I see...

13:24.420 --> 13:25.000
But...

13:25.880 --> 13:28.380
She got along with Fabian just fine.

13:29.920 --> 13:30.920
Is something wrong?

13:30.920 --> 13:32.880
Uh, no! Nothing's wrong.

13:32.880 --> 13:38.130
I think it's more simple than that.
I think she just loves you way too much, Sieg.

13:38.130 --> 13:40.500
In a "I'm so happy it scares me!" kind of way.

13:41.080 --> 13:43.330
I agree with Lady Kobayashie.

13:43.670 --> 13:47.330
I think my sister idolizes you far too much.

13:47.830 --> 13:48.630
Huh?

13:48.920 --> 13:52.790
She glorifies you, as if you're a deity or something.

13:53.080 --> 13:56.000
As if she loves you to the point of worship.

13:56.290 --> 13:58.380
Yes, yes. Exactly!

13:59.540 --> 14:00.290
What?

14:01.290 --> 14:02.500
But what can I do, then?

14:03.330 --> 14:08.790
It's not like she's running away because she doesn't like
you, so why don't you corner her so she can't escape?

14:09.670 --> 14:10.500
"Corner her"?

14:10.750 --> 14:14.750
But would her heart hold out if you did that?

14:15.630 --> 14:21.330
It's fine! Even if her heart stops for a bit,
Sir Richter and I can deal with it, no problem!

14:21.330 --> 14:24.830
That's right, we can cast all the healing spells she needs!

14:25.170 --> 14:27.580
That doesn't sound fine at all.

14:27.920 --> 14:32.040
Well, in any case,
the Witch of Yore's resurrection is imminent.

14:32.880 --> 14:36.500
It seems like Liese-tan's nightmares are
getting more threatening by the day,

14:36.500 --> 14:40.830
so now's the time for us to pull
ourselves together and cooperate.

14:40.830 --> 14:42.380
We're counting on you, Sieg!

14:42.380 --> 14:43.080
Right.

14:47.210 --> 14:49.330
You charmless wretch.

14:49.330 --> 14:51.960
No one would ever love you.

14:53.000 --> 14:55.170
I don't need anyone to love me.

14:55.630 --> 14:57.830
That doesn't change my affection for His Highness!

14:58.920 --> 15:03.580
How do you still not understand?
That man has no feelings for you.

15:03.880 --> 15:05.130
I realize that.

15:05.130 --> 15:07.580
I know that all too well!

15:08.250 --> 15:12.960
Ever since I fainted, His Highness
has clearly been very careful around me.

15:13.420 --> 15:17.670
This... that... everything he has done,
it has all been out of pity.

15:18.080 --> 15:22.670
With every act of kindness, the more
I realize they are not out of love.

15:23.500 --> 15:26.670
Yet I delight in them to the point of frustration.

15:31.080 --> 15:35.290
I feel so humiliated, and sad... and frustrated.

15:40.920 --> 15:46.210
What a fool you are, deceived
by that man's fickle feelings of pity.

15:46.630 --> 15:53.330
That idiot of a man will be swayed by
another woman and cause you further grief.

15:53.790 --> 15:56.500
His Highness would never...

16:03.710 --> 16:06.330
You have no idea how much he has sacrificed his desires

16:06.330 --> 16:11.420
and endured a solitary existence
for the sake of his people.

16:11.750 --> 16:16.080
No, he's a foolish man. He must be.

16:18.040 --> 16:21.040
You... understand nothing!

16:24.880 --> 16:27.580
Insulting him is the one thing...

16:28.380 --> 16:29.460
I shall not tolerate!

16:34.460 --> 16:42.210
I am Lieselotte Riefenstahl, she who has been
blessed by a goddess to protect His Highness.

16:42.580 --> 16:44.500
Don't give in to the stupid Witch of Yore!

16:44.500 --> 16:46.790
Liese-tan! Stay strong!

17:00.790 --> 17:04.040
Don't you dare toy with me...

17:07.170 --> 17:08.540
...Witch of Yore!

17:37.250 --> 17:40.460
I appreciate you accepting
my sudden request to meet with you.

17:41.170 --> 17:43.750
I have something I must speak to you about.

17:44.170 --> 17:46.380
I'm always happy to make time for you.

17:47.080 --> 17:51.670
This must mean my passionate displays
of affection got through to her at last!

17:53.210 --> 17:58.750
I will have you know that I shall never give
in to the likes of the Witch of Yore!

17:59.040 --> 18:00.630
Uh... what?

18:01.290 --> 18:04.790
The reason being that I adore you, Your Highness.

18:04.960 --> 18:10.790
Wait, her words expressed love for me,
but I don't sense any sweetness in her tone.

18:10.790 --> 18:15.420
Indeed, I shall not succumb to such
a meager foe. How could I possibly?

18:15.420 --> 18:19.710
I have discovered that I can converse with the creature
as long as I steel myself enough.

18:19.710 --> 18:24.380
I shall ensure the witch sees how much I adore you,
and just how glorious you are.

18:27.420 --> 18:31.170
The witch will hear me through,
however many nights it may take!

18:31.380 --> 18:33.460
Okay, what's going on?

18:33.460 --> 18:34.670
Congratulations!

18:36.790 --> 18:38.710
Your Lieselotte has evolved from a tsundere...

18:45.540 --> 18:47.790
to a tsundereally-pissed!

18:48.250 --> 18:50.130
Tsun de... really pissed?!

18:50.380 --> 18:56.130
So you should know that I am fine.
I promise you need not worry about me anymore!

18:56.710 --> 18:59.500
Uh, but this conversation is taking an iffy turn.

18:59.500 --> 19:03.130
I think Liese-tan glorifies Sieg so much

19:03.130 --> 19:08.790
that she assumes Sieg's recent change
in behavior has some deeper purpose.

19:11.250 --> 19:17.460
All I truly need is your continued presence,
exactly as you are now.

19:18.170 --> 19:24.790
I will simply love you on my own terms
and that is enough to give my life meaning.

19:25.130 --> 19:26.500
That will keep me going.

19:26.920 --> 19:29.170
So please, I beg of you.

19:29.830 --> 19:33.420
I cannot bear any more of your pity.

19:36.380 --> 19:40.710
Lieselotte. Honestly, you think too highly of me.

19:41.040 --> 19:43.420
Your Highness, wh-what are you-

19:46.580 --> 19:48.250
S-surely you jest.

19:48.670 --> 19:49.460
Liese.

19:50.580 --> 19:54.210
You should know I always wanted
to call you by that name.

19:54.880 --> 19:57.960
I always envied Baldur for being allowed that privilege.

19:58.920 --> 20:02.170
It pained me to see you spend
all of your time with Miss Fiene,

20:02.540 --> 20:07.420
and what's more, I was even jealous of Fabian,
who is still only a child.

20:08.460 --> 20:13.080
I never knew how to express how I really felt,

20:13.710 --> 20:19.830
but I want you, and no one else,
to accept me, ugly feelings and all.

20:23.540 --> 20:27.920
I'm the one who always kept a lid on my feelings.

20:28.630 --> 20:32.920
Ever since I was a little girl, you have
no idea how I envied Artur Richter

20:32.920 --> 20:37.420
and any others who spoke to you on friendly terms.

20:37.830 --> 20:40.920
I was even jealous of Fiene toward the beginning.

20:41.830 --> 20:43.210
We're the same.

20:44.500 --> 20:49.040
Do you really feel the same way as I do, Your Highness?

20:49.630 --> 20:56.830
Do I dare think that you might
somehow love me... as I love you?

20:57.710 --> 21:00.710
I want you to think so, and believe in me.

21:01.750 --> 21:02.790
I love you.

21:04.380 --> 21:12.330
I dreamt that someday you might love me. All this time,
I have always, always wished for this moment.

21:14.250 --> 21:15.290
Liese...

21:23.960 --> 21:24.790
Hmm?

21:25.960 --> 21:28.750
I-I'm suddenly rather embarrassed.

21:29.130 --> 21:34.210
I would rather you not see my face right now,
and I don't think I can let go anytime soon.

21:35.790 --> 21:38.130
Then we'll stay like this for a while longer.

21:39.290 --> 21:40.130
Yes.

21:43.460 --> 21:46.080
Yes! Yes!

21:43.790 --> 21:45.960
Congratulations, Sieg!

21:46.080 --> 21:48.630
Hooray! Whee, yahoo!

21:55.210 --> 21:56.460
Ooh, ow...

22:00.880 --> 22:04.670
S-sorry, Endo. I got too excited.

22:04.670 --> 22:08.000
Uh, that's okay. Does it hurt anywhere?

22:08.000 --> 22:09.250
Um, no.

22:09.880 --> 22:11.000
You, Endo?

22:11.420 --> 22:12.380
I'm fine.

22:15.380 --> 22:17.880
<b>Royal Palace-Drawing Room</b>

22:15.380 --> 22:17.880
<b>Lieselotte</b>

22:15.380 --> 22:17.880
<b>I have always, always wished for this moment.</b>

22:16.130 --> 22:20.460
But you know, we've made
super duper progress, haven't we?

22:20.830 --> 22:21.540
Yeah...!

22:22.210 --> 22:26.580
Even if the Witch of Yore appears at the
Festival of Gratitude, I'm sure we can fend her off.

22:25.000 --> 22:28.000
<b>Love Me</b>

22:25.000 --> 22:28.000
<b>Magically!</b>

22:27.080 --> 22:28.000
Yeah!

22:33.080 --> 22:37.750
A curse be upon them. On that woman... and the world.

22:38.290 --> 22:40.250
Let calamity plague them!

22:43.670 --> 22:49.630
Kurushiku kanjiru hodo mabushii hohoemi o

22:49.630 --> 22:55.290
Imadani massugu mirenai watashi

22:55.750 --> 23:01.880
Kokoro no fukaku de chirabatta kimochi o

23:01.880 --> 23:07.540
Yukkuri atsumete yuku youni

23:08.500 --> 23:14.250
Yozora no hoshi ga subete o

23:15.250 --> 23:20.330
Miteruno? Shitteiruno?

23:21.420 --> 23:26.960
Mado o akete toikakeru

23:27.580 --> 23:30.960
Doushite?

23:32.750 --> 23:38.920
Kono sekai wa kagayaki de michiteiru

23:39.040 --> 23:45.040
Anata no egao ga oshiete kureta

23:45.040 --> 23:51.040
Shiawase na ketsumatsu o negatte shimau no

23:51.420 --> 24:01.250
Anata no soba ni ireta nara

24:01.250 --> 24:03.080
Itsumademo

24:07.460 --> 24:09.420
Itsumademo

24:13.790 --> 24:16.210
Master, do you still sneak food
from the kitchen to snack on?

24:16.210 --> 24:18.540
Of course! Along with Karlchen.

24:18.540 --> 24:19.540
Karl...

24:21.460 --> 24:24.460
Next Episode: The Dress, the School Festival,
and Overflowing Emotions

24:24.460 --> 24:25.500
Squeak squeak!

24:24.960 --> 24:27.960
<b>The Dress, the School Festival, and Overflowing Emotions</b>

24:25.500 --> 24:27.130
Uh, what are you doing?
